      "title": "Recruitment Rolls",
      "text": "Bunks for twenty, and a slate of names pinned above them: miners, hydroponics techs, a teacher from the moon colony. Not soldiers. Colonists.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Copy the rolls for Intelligence",
          "text": "Names, home bodies, who recruited whom. Command will want this.",
